error BYN2806: `Self` has no member `name` in its constraints (`IShape`)

  3 │     string describe() => $"{this.name()}: {area()}"
    │                                  ^^^^
    │
  help: declare `name` in `IShape`; a default method sees only its interface's members

error BYN2806: `T` has no member `perimeter` in its constraints (`IShape`)

  7 │     print($"{shape.perimeter()}")
    │                    ^^^^^^^^^
    │
  help: add an interface declaring `perimeter` to the `where` clause

error BYN2744: `area` is not a member of type parameter `T`

  11 │     print($"{value.area()}")
     │                    ^^^^
     │
  help: add `where T : …` naming an interface that declares `area`, or use a concrete type
